## Third-party content

Template histories under `data/history/` are reconstructed from public commit graphs of Hugging Face
Hub repositories; each repository's own licence governs its template text. The task corpus in
`data/tasks.json` derives from HumanEvalPack and remains under its source licence. The CC BY grant
above covers the collected measurements, metadata and structure, not these third-party texts. No
model weights are redistributed. See THIRD_PARTY.md.
